# data.duckdb is intentionally tracked (via Git LFS - see .gitattributes at
# the repo root and terminal/README.md#deploying-to-vercel), not ignored -
# the deployed Vercel backend reads it directly, read-only, at the same
# path db.py has always used. Regenerate it locally with build_db.py; don't
# untrack it without also updating the Vercel deployment docs.
